Amber Age: Dinosaurs (modid amberage 1.2.0, Forge 66 for Minecraft 26.3), Andy's own mod, made with Claude and GPT.

Its code, models, textures, sounds, recipes, loot and language are used in com.jaymospowers.dino,
com.jaymospowers.client.dino and the dino folders under assets/jaymospowers and data/jaymospowers.

The jar carries "All Rights Reserved" metadata; that is the generated default of the mod template, not a third party's
claim. Andy confirmed it is his work and authorised its reuse here ("yes they were made with claude and gpt",
2026-11-24, recorded in the vault's Decisions log). No other person's code or art is in it.

How it was brought over:
- The jar held compiled classes only, and Andy has no source project (confirmed 2026-11-24). The classes were
  decompiled with Vineflower 1.12.0 and ported to Fabric: Forge registries, config, network channel, events and client
  extensions replaced; names moved to the jaymospowers namespace.
- The .kmdl models and .spec rigs, the textures and the sounds were copied unchanged (only moved under
  assets/jaymospowers/dino, textures/entity/dino, textures/item/dino and sounds/dino).
- Left out: Forge's multi-part hitboxes (Minecraft only supports those for the Ender Dragon).
